      <ol><li>Talk to <b>Elder Maren</b> beside the Echo Stone in the village square. Follow the <b>❖ marker</b>.</li>
      <li>Ancient ruins in five regions each hide an <b>Echo Shard</b>. Pillars of light point the way. Solve the puzzle inside to claim it.</li>
      <li>Bring all five shards back to the Echo Stone to learn the truth.</li>
      <li>Or just explore: climb any wall, open chests, find secrets. The story waits for you.</li></ol>
